{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/35237-the-npc-share-thread","id":35237,"title":"The NPC Share Thread.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-22T18:19:11-08:00","id":35237,"title":"The NPC Share Thread.","content":"Some of us have special characters that we play or use. this thread is mainly to share some of your own characters for others to use.<br /> <br /> Vincent Thomas Crowley. (Alastor) Demon the Fallen.<br /> Roughtly based on the character from Good Omens, Crowley is a Slayer, angel of vengeance who Oddly enough is trying to live in peace within himself, its rumored that hes been around since the late 30's (Thanks to Aliestair Crowley). He acts (and i use him) as a information source, he is the kind of guy that everyone knows and knows everybody. Whenever the players need information, a hint or anything. i use Him, He has people who owes him Favors in every faction (Even a couple of garous who have a love/hate relationship with him), really easy going, laid back and trying his best to Enjoy life before the armageddon comes....and his secret &quot;Wish.&quot; is to find a time machine and go back to watch Queen live.<br /> <br /> Wolfman Jack and Criswell.<br /> Yes, they are dead, Yes, they are wraiths. Live from SDR (Stygian Dead Radio), they transmit to all the World of Darkness, live (or Dead) from the Other Side. Their Shtick is the fact that they play music from EVERY SINGLE ERA from a ghost radio. Always playing with hints and even doing Request (555-1994-THEWOLFCALL).<br /> Wolfman is connected and has informants Everywhere, high charisma. Allowing him to be aware of whats going up &quot;Upstairs.&quot;, since he cant say &quot;IM a Ghost.&quot; on his radio show, he sends hints as for whats going on the WoD through music pieces and dedicating songs from char to char<br /> Example<br /> Wolfman Jack: That was a nice tune, dont you think folks? What?, ok We got a request from Dennis Maxwell to a certain Blue Badge named John O'Malley, This is &quot;The Carpenters.&quot; with Close To You.&quot;<br /> He never explicitly says whats going on , just giving hints through music. and No, he never answers live calls, if you ever call him. youll get a voice of the &quot;Producer.&quot; who will send the message to Wolfman.<br /> <br /> Criswell on the other hand...Ok....Do you remember that EVERY END OF THE WORLD SCENARIO COMES IN A VARIETY OF FLAVOURS AND MIXES?!.... He Takes This concept...turns it inside out...And give missinformation. For Example, lets say that in your game of Gehenna the bad guy is Cain....Criswell will say &quot;The Future is Technological..I see ..Men Wearing Black and Wearing Shades.&quot; The whole point of Criswell is that he is 99.9 always Unacurate..and only 00.1% Accurate.<br /> <br /> Travis Brandon Thy Irish Vampire.<br /> Ok, Long story short, he is Irish, he is a horny bastard, he has Attencion Deficit, He wanted to join the sex pistols but he never could...and he is always horny. His entire Schstick is the fact that he is Not evil, i repeat. He Is Not Evil, he is an gold hearted idiot whos been around ever since the 1975. He is a brujah with a golden heart who funny enough, always looks for friends and not very interested in politics, i used him in my Hunter The Reckoning game as an ally of a redeemer (and they grew fond of him), I based him Heavily on Tires from Spaced if you need to know how he talks and behaves. His whole purpouse (other than comic relief) is to show the humanity among the vampires and the fact that he Might not be connected to anything supernatural outside the vampires, but he always know if theres something going on. He is a mix between Tires and Rocco from The Boondock Saints.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T18:32:20-08:00","id":35250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/35237-the-npc-share-thread#post35237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Criswell on the other hand...Ok....Do you remember that EVERY END OF THE WORLD SCENARIO COMES IN A VARIETY OF FLAVOURS AND MIXES?!.... He Takes This concept...turns it inside out...And give missinformation. For Example, lets say that in your game of Gehenna the bad guy is Cain....Criswell will say &quot;The Future is Technological..I see ..Men Wearing Black and Wearing Shades.&quot; The whole point of Criswell is that he is 99.9 always Unacurate..and only 00.1% Accurate.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know it's slightly off-topic, and it's not my group so it doesn't really matter, but it seems to me that this is one of those ideas that's better in concept than practise? I mean, being 99% wrong, but right about some tiny detail can very easily be written off as just dumb luck, and unless it's actually helpful (which, obviously, 99% of the time it won't be), the players'd just end up ignoring him?<br /> <br /> But that's just my opinion on the matter: if you've had luck using him, I'd be happy to hear about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T18:43:57-08:00","id":35259,"title":"","content":"Honestly, i use him to mindfuck my players, right now they are VERY AWARE of the existance of God45.. today we were playing, they got into the dead radio and they heard criswell saying<br /> &quot;A God Like Figure will Appear infront of the Sinners!!!!&quot; my players were like &quot;Oh Fuck..&quot; so they took every kind of gun and ran away......who was the godlike figure? no one xD! it was just to fuck with their minds for a little bit","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T18:46:31-08:00","id":35264,"title":"","content":"Tinker 'Bring Em Back Alive' Thompson A surprisingly long-lived Formor, App 0, ugly as sin. A mix of Paocher Percival C McLeach from Rescuers Down Under and a real person mentioned in a book called The Gentle Jungle. He's a bad guy for all systems. Not as Spongecake as Sam Height, he's just crafty, clever and ruthless. He's the middle man between the characters targeted by Vampires, Pentex, Shadow Court, you name it. He always gets his prey and truly upholds his rep to Bring em back Alive. What happens after delivery is none of his business and he hasn't had anyone escape him yet. Last I used him he convinced a wayward young metis Spiral to join his side. Now it's just him, his camper and his good buddy Scabby traveling the world. You never know when the trapper from hell will turn up to trap YOU!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T20:14:51-08:00","id":35322,"title":"","content":"Ironwolf, Glasswalker, Rank 3.<br /> This son of a bitch is a metis with the biggest defect me and the GM could think of, You know how every Glasswalker is slightly attuned to the weaver?, Well...Ironwolf is HEAVILY ATTUNED TO THE WEAVER. He shows NO EMOTIONS, Only rational though and..Yes, He is Completely INSANE.<br /> Whats his Deal, He knows that the Wyrm WILL defeat the garous. So....<br /> A ) He wants to bring back all the dead garous he can through Science and make a sort of Undead Werewolf Army. How did came to be, a galliard told him about the lord of the rings and he started to think a lot about Aragorn using the Army of Ghosts....<br /> B ) Most of his body is cybernetics (both legs and one arm), he uses the unlimited ammo gift and has a lot of resistance related gifts.<br /> C ) He KNOWS how to defeat (Not Kill) Both The Wyrm and The Weaver....but The Garou nation is extremedly cautious about this information, specially since they dont trust him.<br /> I personally concider him a Sociopath, His aspirations are to Win the War and Replace the weaver under the idea of &quot;She is insane, her process is over, she needs to be replaced with a more fitting update.&quot;<br /> Calm, Controlated, Distant and Incredibly Patient. When he fights he goes through the Sherlock Strategy, Calculated movements and hits. Funny enough he is not a loner, he works with a pack but they try to keep him in check. Imagine him as a more cold Herbert West mixed with a Borg.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"